          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:20.50" defaultTabSize="72"><strong><span color="rgba(217, 138, 33, 1)" fontSize="15.5" fontFamily="Heiti SC" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">对照也只有 38% 阳性</span></strong></p>
