      <shape width="233.591968503937" height="133.92" topLeftX="66.24" topLeftY="216" type="text" id="brD">
        <content verticalAlign="top" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:18.50" defaultTabSize="72"><span color="rgba(22, 34, 46, 1)" fontSize="12.5" fontFamily="Heiti SC" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">112 名可观察指令反应者中仅 43 人（38%）在任务态 fMRI/EEG 上出现对应反应。说明任务范式本身假阴性率很高。</span></p>
        </content>
