          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:20.50" defaultTabSize="72"><strong><span color="rgba(23, 82, 122, 1)" fontSize="15.5" fontFamily="Heiti SC" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">技术覆盖并不完整</span></strong></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="233.591968503937" height="133.92" topLeftX="363.191968503937" topLeftY="216" type="text" id="brr">
        <content verticalAlign="top" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:18.50" defaultTabSize="72"><span color="rgba(22, 34, 46, 1)" fontSize="12.5" fontFamily="Heiti SC" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">多数患者只做了单模态检查（仅 fMRI 或仅 EEG），而 60 例阳性里有 36 例是双模态共同检出——真实的 CMD 比例只会更高。</span></p>
        </content>
