          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:18.50" defaultTabSize="72"><span color="rgba(22, 34, 46, 1)" fontSize="12.5" fontFamily="Heiti SC" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">CMD 与更年轻、伤后时间更长、创伤性病因相关，但这是观察性结果，不能读成因果解释。</span></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
