    <note id="bwn">
      <content>
        <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2" defaultTabSize="72"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" fontFamily="等线" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">这一页是这篇文献的诚实边界，也是后面所有讨论的前提。</span></p>
        <p><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" fontFamily="等线" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">重点：对照组 38% 的检出率，说明范式灵敏度有限，所以 25% 是下限。</span></p>
        <p><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" fontFamily="等线" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">收尾一定要读那句双向边界。</span></p>
      </content>
    </note>
